<span data-as="p">The announcement cited an evaluation run on FrontierHarness Eval: MiniMax Code v0.3.2 paired with Kimi K3 passed 23 of 30 tasks, a 76.7% pass rate, with a median runtime of 4 minutes 33 seconds per successful task. The <a href="https://github.com/frontier-harness-eval/eval/pull/13" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">evaluation report</a> keeps the results and the comparison methodology.</span>
